    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "rutli_keystore_unreadable per cosigner: 1 (red) while the node cannot list or write data_dir/keys, or cannot open a key file in it — it answers UNAVAILABLE, reports NOT_SERVING, and the other leaders skip it — 0 (green) otherwise. Grey means the cosigner is not scraped at all (up == 0). The probe runs every 15s and the gauge clears on its own once the volume is fixed: fix the volume, do not restart the pod. Alert: RutliKeystoreUnreadable (critical).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 80, "lineWidth": 0 },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "readable" },
                "1": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "UNREADABLE" },
                "2": { "color": "#808080", "index": 2, "text": "down" }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "#808080", "value": 2 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "alignValue": "left",
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": false },
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "showValue": "auto",
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (instance) (rutli_keystore_unreadable) or on (instance) max by (instance) ((up{job=\"rutli-cosigner\"} == 0) + 2)",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Key store readiness",
      "type": "state-timeline"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Skips each leader recorded in the trailing 5 minutes (increase(rutli_sign_round1_skips_total[5m])). The counter lives on the healthy node doing the skipping and carries no label for the skipped peer, so read it against Key store readiness and Cosigners Up: the instances that climb are the healthy leaders, and the instance that stays flat — red or grey in Key store readiness — is the one being skipped around. Any skip means signing with less margin than deployed. Alert: RutliPeerSkips.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
